The only way to get the Orb is to self-convert to neutral. This can be
accomplished by finding a neutral altar and either sacrificing a co-
aligned unicorn or reducing your alignment to "strayed" or worse
before sacrificing. Be warned that you must complete the quest before
conversion or the game will be unwinnable.


